<title>USA: Bell Atlantic shareholders approve merger.</title>
<headline>Bell Atlantic shareholders approve merger.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bell Atlantic Corp said Friday its shareholders approved its merger with NYNEX Corp.</p>
<p>The merger is expected to close in the first quarter of 1997. The deal, which is valued at about $22 billion, was announced in April.</p>
</text>
